                            	  4912: UpdateDodongoState_JumpTable:
02:0003A332 0003A33E        	  4913:     dc.l    UpdateDodongoState0_Move   ; jump table entry (32-bit for _m68k_tablejump)
02:0003A336 0003A3A2        	  4914:     dc.l    UpdateDodongoState1_Bloated   ; jump table entry (32-bit for _m68k_tablejump)
02:0003A33A 0003A39C        	  4915:     dc.l    UpdateDodongoState2_Stunned   ; jump table entry (32-bit for _m68k_tablejump)
