                            	  5741: Wizzrobe_DrawAndCheckCollisionsIntermittently:
                            	  5742:     ; If the teleporting distance remaining is even, then draw
                            	  5743:     ; and check collisions, else return.
                            	  5744:     ;
                            	  5745:     ; This means that when 0, the monster is walking.
                            	  5746:     ; So, draw and check collisions every frame.
                            	  5747:     ;
                            	  5748:     ; When not 0, the monster is teleporting, and must be drawn
                            	  5749:     ; translucently -- every other frame.
                            	  5750:     ;
02:0003A9BA 41EC0394        	  5751:     lea     ($0394,A4),A0
02:0003A9BE 10302000        	  5752:     move.b  (A0,D2.W),D0
02:0003A9C2 E208            	  5753:     lsr.b  #1,D0   ; LSR A
