                            	  9047:     ; Look up the item for this room, and store it.
                            	  9048:     ; If it's item ID 3, then deactivate the object.
                            	  9049:     ;
                            	  9050:     ; Item ID 3 normally means the master sword. But because the
                            	  9051:     ; usual value meaning "no item" ($3F) can't fit in the level
                            	  9052:     ; block attribute for a room item (up to $1F); use 3 to
                            	  9053:     ; stand in for it.
                            	  9054:     ;
